  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yashksaini-coder/Rustlens/zipball/v0.2.1",
  "body": "## Rustlens v0.2.1 — Rebrand Release\n\nThe project has been renamed from **vizier-tui** to **rustlens** — a name confirmed available on crates.io.\n\n### What changed\n- Crate name: `vizier-tui` → `rustlens`\n- Binary name: `vizier` → `rustlens`\n- All internal types renamed (`VizierUi` → `RustlensUi`, `VizierError` → `RustlensError`)\n- New RUSTLENS ASCII art logo in header\n- Config path: `~/.config/vizier/` → `~/.config/rustlens/`\n- Updated CI/CD, docs, and all branding\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\ncargo install rustlens\n```\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/yashksaini-coder/Rustlens/compare/v0.2.0...v0.2.1"
